ght straight people have  always been able to get married to those  to whom they are attracted I don't even  want to dignify that part any further  the idea of you know a white pride group  a white student union or  whatever as the same thing as a Latino  Student Union well you're not talking  about a historically marginalized and  oppressed group and we have to really  examine what the motivations are of a  lot of those groups and the motivations  aren't good okay so that that's where  we're going to stop with that analysis  because it's such a stupid analysis that  it doesn't even need to be done one  reason I didn't go is I don't want to  give them attention  I think counter protesting is totally  valid but they aren't really marching  for straight pride they are marching to  anger people they are marching to  trigger and own the libs as they like to  say and some of them are marching  because they genuinely struggle with  their masculinity but that's a whole  other story  which we're not going to talk about  today very few of them actually show up  to this stuff to really protest and  again there were more counter protesters  this time around what would happen if  nobody showed up to counter protest and  however many people I don't even know  how many marchers there were was it a  few dozen was it a hundred people a  couple I don't know imagine if no one  gave them any attention they show up  they march around with their maggots and  their build the wall signs and they're  totally ignored no one protests no one  cares no one tries to fight the permit  for the parade they are just ignored no  one writes about it they are irrelevant  I think that that actually is a really  great scenario now again I was out of  town anyway and there were all sorts of  security concerns in terms of some of  the extremist groups that were coming in  but these are just small groups of  people doing really dumb things what if  we did just ignore them now other  perspectives are valid 